{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport secrets,json,pathlib\nnames=['Bomb Squad Goals','Bombs Away Team','Bomb Squad Shenanigans','Bomb Squad After Hours','Bomb Squad Unplugged','Bombs and Recreation','Bomb Squad Odd Jobs','Bomb Squad Sparks Fly','Bombsquadron','Bomb Squad Last Call','Bomb Squad Tick Tock','Bomb Squad Short Fuse','Bomb Squad Joint Custody','Bomb Squad Wire Service','Bomb Squad No Pressure','Bomb Squad Circuit Circus','Bomb Squad Snip Happens','Bomb Squad Cut Above','Bomb Squad Hot Solder','Bomb Squad Fuse Cruise','Bomb Squad Dial Disarm','Bomb Squad Spare Parts','Bomb Squad Terminally Helpful','Bomb Squad City Snips','Bomb Squad Night Shift','Bomb Squad Panic Picnic','Bomb Squad Socket Science','Bomb Squad Solder On','Bomb Squad Second Guess','Bomb Squad Ticklish Business','Bomb Squad Close Circuit','Bomb Squad Bright Sparks','Bomb Squad Mixed Signals','Bomb Squad Lead the Way','Bomb Squad Wired Company','Bomb Squad Safety Third','Bomb Squad Part Time Heroes','Bomb Squad All Wired Up','Bomb Squad Code Courtesy','Bomb Squad Nerves of Tin','Bomb Squad Fuse Finesse','Bomb Squad Blip Service','Bomb Squad Snip Shift','Bomb Squad Circuit Break','Bomb Squad Time to Spare','Bomb Squad Countdown Crew','Bomb Squad Cobalt Call','Bomb Squad Joint Effort','Bomb Squad Disarm Charm','Bomb Squad Circuit Serenade']\ni=secrets.randbelow(50); title=names[i]; slug=title.replace(' ','-')+'-Bomb-Squad-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-044353'\ndev=pathlib.Path(slug); dev.mkdir()\nfor d in ['vendor','src','tools','tests','docs','evidence']: (dev/d).mkdir()\n(dev/'run.json').write_text(json.dumps({'title':title,'slug':slug,'source':'Bomb Squad (1982)','titleSelection':{'procedure':'50 original riffs; secrets.randbelow(50)','selectedIndex':i+1,'count':50}},indent=2)+'\\\\n')\npathlib.Path('PROGRESS.md').write_text(f'''# Build progress\\\\n\\\\nGame: **{title}**\\\\nDevelopment folder: \"'`{slug}/`'\"\\\\nRoot artifact: \"'`{slug}.html`'\"\\\\nRequired report: \"'`exit-interview.json`'\"\\\\n\\\\n## Current state\\\\n- Read PLAN.md and TASK.md in full; read game-toolchain skill.\\\\n- Researched original manual and creator history; screenshot fetch pending.\\\\n- Selected title using a cryptographic random index over 50 silently brainstormed riffs.\\\\n- Implementing source/contracts gate.\\\\n\\\\n## Next work\\\\n1. Fetch full engine handoff and official Hub client/harness; inspect contracts.\\\\n2. Build native scene + deterministic repair simulation and all authored cases.\\\\n3. Integrate input, audio, multiplayer, tools, and attract; validate and package.\\\\n\\\\n## Constraints\\\\n- All dev work stays in development folder; root holds required deliverables and progress.\\\\n- Single HTML, native engine, procedural audio, music default 0.1.\\\\n- One command: node tools/verify.mjs; quiet except failures and count.\\\\n- Owned loopback servers only, OS-selected ports; no neighboring workspaces.\\\\n''')\nprint(json.dumps({'title':title,'dev':slug}))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
