{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"agent_message","text":"The repair model and native board assets are in place. Repairs require both cuts, removal, replacement, and both solder joints; wrong cuts have recovery windows, failed parts return to usable stock, and fires persist until extinguished. Next I’m connecting the model to the playable screens and shared-game transports.\n"}}
