{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_111","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> docs/testing.md <<'EOF'\n| D013 | high | Live-tuning and editor browser workflow | Custom Back callbacks called the native Back method recursively, trapping developer submenus. Pop the owned screen through the native default path and restore the correct layout on resume. |\n| D014 | medium | Controller dial/source review | Native same-screen refresh lost focus because it reused an already-cleared focus field. A small E.Shell.show patch preserves the active widget during refresh; tested by repeated pad digit increments and complete pad disposal. |\nEOF\npython3 - <<'PY'\np='docs/research.md';s=open(p).read().replace('Engine changes: none. Original extensions use documented registries and native APIs.', 'Engine change: E.Shell.show now retains the focused widget when the same screen refreshes. See docs/engine-changes.md and its focused patch. Original assets and mechanics use documented registries and native APIs.');open(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nnode tools/verify.mjs sim engine\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
